    "title": "Five men arrested in undercover child exploitation operation in Marlborough - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Writer ,\n1 days ago MARLBOROUGH — Five men were arrested during a recent undercover operation targeting individuals attempting to engage in illegal sexual activity with a minor. According to the Marlborough Police Department, Marlborough police participated in the operation, which was part of a federal task force operation involving Homeland Security Investigations (HSI) that took place in Marlborough. Read full article\n2",
